{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12105450","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105450","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1210544001:":{"text":"Tesio!","source_cn":"泰西欧！！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x770C39392C4DEAEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210545001:0":{"text":"Magister, they're running towards the bridge!","source_cn":"主人，他们往桥那边跑了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFA65CF949FAEAA62","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Magister, they're running towards the bridge!","female":"Magister, they're running towards the bridge!","variant_male_record_index":"130068","variant_female_record_index":"130069","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210545002:1":{"text":"To the southwest is... <style=\"highlight\">Brineville</style>?","source_cn":"西南边是……小水村？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3820497B5F02AFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210545003:1":{"text":"That's right. The village with those women.","source_cn":"没错，那些女人的村子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34265352342042C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1210545003":{"text":"That's right. The village with those women.","source_cn":"没错，那些女人的村子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34265352342042C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210545004:1":{"text":"Sinbad's home is a village run by a group of widows. After Sinbad's father died, those women raised him.","source_cn":"辛巴达的家，一群海员遗孀撑起的地方，辛巴达的父亲死后，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AEA85E714F0030C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210545005:1":{"text":"Chippy didn't know that about him...","source_cn":"看不出来，那个吊儿郎当的家伙居然……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5CF906406938A3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210545006:1":{"text":"You three go on ahead. Lucca and I will bring more men to support you as soon as we can.","source_cn":"行了，你们先去追，我和卢卡随后带人支援你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08E1A3A46AA7A4AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210545007:1":{"text":"Wait, why should we help you chase down your enemy?","source_cn":"等等，我们为什么要帮你们追叛徒？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85B59804CCCA898","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210545008:1":{"text":"Yes, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is not one of your followers. Neither are Chippy and I.","source_cn":"对，<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD137C79BC9ABDF40","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yes, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is not one of your followers. Neither are Chippy and I.","female":"Yes, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> is not one of your followers. Neither are Chippy and I.","variant_male_record_index":"130076","variant_female_record_index":"130077","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210545009:1":{"text":"Rustport is being targeted by the Water Wights and the Dead Tide Fleet. They bribed Tesio, and now he's working for them. The Carmine Whispers need your help.","source_cn":"锈锚港现在被水鬼和死潮舰队针对，泰西欧又被他们收买了，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B8716082EE6D2A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210545010:1":{"text":"If you don't want to, I can also arrange a boat to take you away.","source_cn":"如果你们不愿意，我也可以安排船送你们离开——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x587C44B5AEA1E89C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210545011:1":{"text":"No, the kraken is still out there!","source_cn":"不行，那个长着触手的大家伙还在海上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF68980086407E51D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1210545012:1":{"text":"Then let's destroy the Dead Tide Fleet together, or else you'll never be able to leave.","source_cn":"那就和我一起除掉死潮舰队吧。死潮不除，你们没法顺利离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3ED4B8EF09C8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1210545012":{"text":"Then let's destroy the Dead Tide Fleet together, or else you'll never be able to leave.","source_cn":"那就和我一起除掉死潮舰队吧。死潮不除，你们没法顺利离开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC3ED4B8EF09C8A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1210545013:1":{"text":"Tesio, the Water Wights, the Dead Tide Fleet... Defeat and capture them in one fell swoop.","source_cn":"泰西欧，水鬼帮，死潮舰队，逐个击破，一网打尽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x243C963B1EF64510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1210545013":{"text":"Tesio, the Water Wights, the Dead Tide Fleet... Defeat and capture them in one fell swoop.","source_cn":"泰西欧，水鬼帮，死潮舰队，逐个击破，一网打尽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x243C963B1EF64510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1210545014:1":{"text":"I hope we work well together. I'll see you later.","source_cn":"合作愉快，再会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B9EB59E0DFC036D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1210545015:1":{"text":"Of course, they want to work with us. Only Magister Merlin can deal with these types of situations.","source_cn":"又是合作……果然，他们没了梅林就解决不了问题。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD3A3B5880F6468BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Of course, they want to work with us. Only Magister Merlin can deal with these types of situations.","female":"Of course, they want to work with us. Only Magister Merlin can deal with these types of situations.","variant_male_record_index":"130084","variant_female_record_index":"130085","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1210545016:1":{"text":"That's the problem with being so powerful. Everyone wants your help. Alright, let's catch up to them.","source_cn":"或许这就是强大的烦恼吧，我们赶紧追上，别跟丢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1251E894531F33DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:0:1":{"text":"I'd be happy to see them go down.","source_cn":"我也看水鬼和死潮不爽","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAEFCBE7A776D6BA6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'd be happy to see them go down.","female":"I'd be happy to see them go down.","variant_male_record_index":"65564","variant_female_record_index":"65565","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:1:2":{"text":"Sounds good.","source_cn":"听起来不错","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA4ABB984AB890F41","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Sounds good.","female":"Sounds good.","var